HarnessMM
Copyright 2026 PhiAgent-0 contributors

This repository extracts the HarnessMM implementation from the PhiAgent research
workspace maintained by Yuhua Jiang. The Python package is named harnessmm;
legacy phiagent imports and original protocol identifiers remain supported.
Deployment paths and hostnames
were replaced with placeholders for this public release.

The project source retains its Apache License, Version 2.0 terms. Upstream
agent runtimes, benchmarks, datasets, model weights and separately installed
dependencies are governed by their respective licenses and access terms.
No upstream model weights, benchmark datasets or native runtime checkouts are
redistributed in this repository.
